WEBVTT

00:00.427 --> 00:04.967
<b>[relaxing music]</b>

00:06.177 --> 00:09.887
<b>[grunts]</b>

00:13.857 --> 00:15.107
<b>[EMILIA] Subaru.</b>

00:18.107 --> 00:19.777
<b>What's wrong?</b>

00:19.817 --> 00:21.947
<b>I've just got some nerves.</b>

00:21.987 --> 00:25.367
<b>Well, considering where
we're headed to, you know?</b>

00:25.407 --> 00:26.367
<b>Of course.</b>

00:26.407 --> 00:27.617
<b>Ram and Rem are coming</b>

00:27.657 --> 00:28.827
<b>with us this time.</b>

00:28.867 --> 00:30.617
<b>Not to mention,
we'll have Meili,</b>

00:30.667 --> 00:33.167
<b>and our guide, Ms. Anastasia.</b>

00:33.207 --> 00:35.837
<b>Please know I'm also
here to keep you safe.</b>

00:35.877 --> 00:37.167
<b>Wait, what?</b>

00:37.207 --> 00:38.667
<b>You're really lumping
me in with the people</b>

00:38.717 --> 00:39.877
<b>who need protecting?</b>

00:39.917 --> 00:41.507
<b>[growling]</b>

00:41.547 --> 00:42.757
<b>[MEILI] Oh, dear.</b>

00:42.797 --> 00:44.177
<b>I don't think these two like</b>

00:44.217 --> 00:45.347
<b>the mabeast smell I have</b>

00:45.387 --> 00:47.267
<b>on me very much, I'm afraid.</b>

00:47.307 --> 00:48.887
<b>Hey, you can't
do that, Joseph.</b>

00:48.927 --> 00:50.177
<b>Let her go.</b>

00:52.477 --> 00:54.017
<b>What a good boy.</b>

00:56.897 --> 00:59.397
<b>Gently stroking
the neck like this</b>

00:59.437 --> 01:01.947
<b>has a calming effect
on most land dragons.</b>

01:01.987 --> 01:02.947
<b>Oh, really?</b>

01:02.987 --> 01:03.947
<b>Let's see.</b>

01:03.987 --> 01:05.617
<b>That true, Patrasche?</b>

01:06.697 --> 01:08.617
<b>Guess it doesn't always work.</b>

01:08.657 --> 01:12.167
<b>So, uh, whatever you do, be
sure not to leave me alone</b>

01:12.207 --> 01:13.667
<b>with that one, all right?</b>

01:13.707 --> 01:16.287
<b>Otherwise, I might
just get gobbled up.</b>

01:16.337 --> 01:18.417
<b>Nothing that scary
is going to happen.</b>

01:18.457 --> 01:21.007
<b>My Patrasche is a vegetarian.</b>

01:21.047 --> 01:24.387
<b>[ROSWAAL] Subaru, Ms.
Emilia, there's something</b>

01:24.427 --> 01:26.347
<b>about Ram you should know.</b>

01:27.927 --> 01:28.927
<b>[SUBARU] Got it.</b>

01:28.967 --> 01:30.307
<b>Do feel free to ask her</b>

01:30.347 --> 01:31.937
<b>about the matter directly.</b>

01:31.977 --> 01:34.437
<b>Beatrice can also
give you more details.</b>

01:34.477 --> 01:35.767
<b>Don't worry.</b>

01:35.807 --> 01:37.107
<b>We'll do everything we can</b>

01:37.147 --> 01:38.897
<b>to give Ram our full support.</b>

01:40.647 --> 01:42.237
<b>[FREDERICA] Master?</b>

01:42.277 --> 01:45.617
<b>Both ladies are prepared
and ready for the journey now.</b>

01:45.657 --> 01:47.117
<b>[ROSWAAL] Wonderful.</b>

01:47.157 --> 01:50.447
<b>Ram, do practice caution
during your travels.</b>

01:50.487 --> 01:54.327
<b>Thank you for granting me
my request, however selfish.</b>

01:54.367 --> 01:56.417
<b>I swear, I'll
return with results</b>

01:56.457 --> 01:58.667
<b>that meet your expectations.</b>

01:58.707 --> 02:02.007
<b>Subaru-- I mean,
sir, be careful.</b>

02:02.047 --> 02:03.427
<b>I will.</b>

02:03.467 --> 02:05.427
<b>OK, Petra and Frederica, hold</b>

02:05.467 --> 02:07.597
<b>down the fort while we're gone.</b>

02:07.637 --> 02:09.057
<b>Yes.</b>

02:09.097 --> 02:11.097
<b>You needn't even ask.</b>

02:14.307 --> 02:15.767
<b>Right.</b>

02:15.807 --> 02:17.477
<b>To Auguria Dunes.</b>

02:17.517 --> 02:19.187
<b>Let's go.</b>

02:20.937 --> 02:25.987
<b>[theme music]</b>

02:26.027 --> 02:33.327
<b>♪ ♪</b>

03:51.947 --> 03:56.617
<b>[wind blowing]</b>

04:12.177 --> 04:13.927
<b>What can I get you?</b>

04:13.967 --> 04:16.177
<b>Milk, please.</b>

04:16.217 --> 04:17.887
<b>A cold one.</b>

04:17.937 --> 04:19.097
<b>Same here.</b>

04:19.137 --> 04:20.477
<b>Make mine hot.</b>

04:21.807 --> 04:23.107
<b>[SUBARU] I get
the feeling business</b>

04:23.147 --> 04:25.227
<b>isn't exactly booming here.</b>

04:25.267 --> 04:28.197
<b>You must not get very many
customers during the sand time?</b>

04:28.237 --> 04:29.817
<b>Yeah, this town doesn't have</b>

04:29.857 --> 04:31.027
<b>a lot of outsiders</b>

04:31.067 --> 04:33.157
<b>passing through as it is.</b>

04:33.197 --> 04:35.327
<b>So, what are
the two of you doing</b>

04:35.367 --> 04:38.747
<b>all the way out in Mirula,
during the sand time at that?</b>

04:38.787 --> 04:42.457
<b>You see, we're going
to conquer the Auguria Dunes.</b>

04:43.537 --> 04:47.417
<b>Some words of advice,
leave or you'll die.</b>

04:47.457 --> 04:48.967
<b>Not an option.</b>

04:49.007 --> 04:52.257
<b>There are some things that
you have to see through.</b>

04:53.757 --> 04:56.347
<b>[sighs]</b>

04:57.507 --> 04:59.097
<b>400.</b>

04:59.137 --> 05:02.307
<b>It's been 400 years since
anyone's managed to reach it.</b>

05:02.347 --> 05:04.227
<b>The dunes are
infested with mabeasts</b>

05:04.267 --> 05:06.107
<b>and the witch's miasma.</b>

05:06.147 --> 05:09.647
<b>You can walk forever and never
get any closer to that tower.</b>

05:09.687 --> 05:11.777
<b>You'd be lucky
to make it back alive.</b>

05:11.817 --> 05:15.197
<b>Most who've tried are still
out there, buried in the sand.</b>

05:16.277 --> 05:19.327
<b>So, don't try, take my advice.</b>

05:19.367 --> 05:20.907
<b>[EMILIA] I'm sorry.</b>

05:20.957 --> 05:22.117
<b>I get it.</b>

05:22.167 --> 05:23.417
<b>I can tell that</b>

05:23.457 --> 05:26.167
<b>you really care for our safety.</b>

05:26.207 --> 05:27.167
<b>I don't.</b>

05:27.207 --> 05:28.207
<b>I'm just getting</b>

05:28.257 --> 05:29.757
<b>sick and tired of it,</b>

05:29.797 --> 05:31.717
<b>of watching young,
careless folks like you</b>

05:31.757 --> 05:32.927
<b>make the same mistakes.</b>

05:32.967 --> 05:34.217
<b>That's all.</b>

05:36.547 --> 05:38.307
<b>[EMILIA] Thank you
for the drinks.</b>

05:38.347 --> 05:41.267
<b>And thank you for being
open about all that, too.</b>

05:41.307 --> 05:42.637
<b>You've been a big help.</b>

05:42.687 --> 05:43.637
<b>Later.</b>

05:43.687 --> 05:47.397
<b>[clanging]</b>

05:53.067 --> 05:56.407
<b>I heard something
that might help you out.</b>

05:56.447 --> 05:58.407
<b>The past year or so,
folks have been seeing</b>

05:58.447 --> 06:00.747
<b>birds flying over the dunes.</b>

06:00.787 --> 06:03.117
<b>The people who've seen
'em say the same thing,</b>

06:03.157 --> 06:05.287
<b>no matter what, the birds
always seem to be</b>

06:05.327 --> 06:07.417
<b>heading toward that tower.</b>

06:07.457 --> 06:11.587
<b>So, if you do end up getting
lost, look to the sky.</b>

06:11.627 --> 06:14.927
<b>If you're lucky, you might find
a guide to show you the way.</b>

06:16.177 --> 06:17.387
<b>Mister.</b>

06:17.427 --> 06:19.387
<b>Well, if you're already lost</b>

06:19.427 --> 06:21.517
<b>out there with nowhere to turn,</b>

06:21.557 --> 06:24.937
<b>I'd say your luck's
probably run out already.</b>

06:24.977 --> 06:26.937
<b>[EMILIA] The Pleiades
Watchtower.</b>

06:26.977 --> 06:30.477
<b>The home of that
powerful sage of legend.</b>

06:30.517 --> 06:34.697
<b>[mysterious music]</b>

06:37.367 --> 06:39.697
<b>How have your spirits
been acting since?</b>

06:39.737 --> 06:41.037
<b>Mostly the same.</b>

06:41.077 --> 06:43.497
<b>They still remain
by my side, as usual,</b>

06:43.537 --> 06:45.707
<b>though they seem perplexed.</b>

06:45.747 --> 06:49.747
<b>My divine protection of guiding
spirits seems to be intact.</b>

06:49.787 --> 06:51.797
<b>Though at present, they
seem unsure why they find it</b>

06:51.837 --> 06:53.917
<b>so difficult to leave my side.</b>

06:53.957 --> 06:55.467
<b>So they've forgotten.</b>

06:55.507 --> 06:58.297
<b>But the contract you
made hasn't been broken.</b>

06:59.797 --> 07:03.137
<b>Basically, I can only
fulfill my duty as a knight</b>

07:03.177 --> 07:05.347
<b>with my swordsmanship.</b>

07:05.387 --> 07:07.557
<b>Without spirit arts
at my disposal,</b>

07:07.597 --> 07:10.437
<b>my capacity has dropped
rather significantly.</b>

07:12.227 --> 07:13.777
<b>I'm the one in this
predicament.</b>

07:13.817 --> 07:16.277
<b>Why do you appear even
more vexed than I?</b>

07:16.317 --> 07:18.067
<b>Don't you go making stuff up.</b>

07:18.117 --> 07:19.697
<b>Why the hell would I
be the slightest bit</b>

07:19.737 --> 07:21.237
<b>upset you've gotten weaker?</b>

07:21.277 --> 07:22.867
<b>Who gave you that idea?</b>

07:25.157 --> 07:27.747
<b>[JULIUS] You are less
suited to keeping secrets</b>

07:27.787 --> 07:29.207
<b>than I had realized.</b>

07:29.247 --> 07:30.957
<b>Heh, I believe I've come</b>

07:30.997 --> 07:32.547
<b>to understand you more fully</b>

07:32.587 --> 07:33.587
<b>through our travels together.</b>

07:33.627 --> 07:34.627
<b>[SUBARU] Ha.</b>

07:34.667 --> 07:35.967
<b>Well, same here.</b>

07:36.007 --> 07:38.007
<b>If this keeps up
and nothing else happens,</b>

07:38.047 --> 07:41.467
<b>I'm going to be a Julius expert
by the time we reach the tower.</b>

07:41.507 --> 07:43.057
<b>Don't worry about that.</b>

07:43.097 --> 07:44.677
<b>There's no doubt in my mind.</b>

07:44.717 --> 07:46.637
<b>Aside from myself,
of course, there's</b>

07:46.677 --> 07:49.227
<b>not a person in the world
who knows me better than you.</b>

07:49.267 --> 07:52.397
<b>I had to go and get myself
stuck with that crappy title.</b>

07:52.437 --> 07:53.937
<b>Damn.</b>

07:53.977 --> 07:56.317
<b>Subaru, you can't
keep playing around</b>

07:56.357 --> 07:58.277
<b>like that forever, I suppose.</b>

07:58.317 --> 07:59.907
<b>The sand time is
about to start,</b>

07:59.947 --> 08:01.737
<b>so we need to concentrate.</b>

08:06.827 --> 08:11.957
<b>[whooshing]</b>

08:17.007 --> 08:18.627
<b>[SUBARU] Hang
in there, Patrasche.</b>

08:18.677 --> 08:20.137
<b>You too, Joseph.</b>

08:21.427 --> 08:22.887
<b>We've got wind and miasma.</b>

08:22.927 --> 08:24.967
<b>We need to watch out
for mabeasts, too.</b>

08:25.007 --> 08:27.637
<b>Also, it's imperative that
we keep an eye on the tower</b>

08:27.677 --> 08:30.227
<b>so we don't end up
lost, I suppose.</b>

08:30.267 --> 08:31.937
<b>[SUBARU] I don't
know about that.</b>

08:31.977 --> 08:34.817
<b>I feel like it'd be pretty hard
to lose sight of that thing.</b>

08:34.857 --> 08:36.607
<b>[BEATRICE] Betty agrees
with your assessment,</b>

08:36.647 --> 08:40.107
<b>but we must expect
the unexpected, I suppose.</b>

08:40.147 --> 08:42.697
<b>The fact is, no one
has ever made it there,</b>

08:42.737 --> 08:43.947
<b>so anything can happen.</b>

08:43.987 --> 08:45.237
<b>[SUBARU] That is true.</b>

08:46.867 --> 08:48.457
<b>Ms. Anastasia.</b>

08:49.907 --> 08:50.997
<b>What's up?</b>

08:51.037 --> 08:52.287
<b>You're sure
the best thing to do</b>

08:52.327 --> 08:54.207
<b>is keep going straight ahead?</b>

08:54.247 --> 08:56.747
<b>Oh, come on, why are you
acting so suspicious of</b>

08:56.797 --> 08:58.087
<b>me, Natsuki?</b>

08:58.127 --> 09:00.547
<b>We're all in the same
boat here, you know.</b>

09:00.587 --> 09:02.257
<b>So you can be more trusting.</b>

09:02.297 --> 09:04.387
<b>You're asking
him to trust a fox.</b>

09:04.427 --> 09:07.097
<b>That's easier said
than done, I suppose.</b>

09:07.137 --> 09:09.727
<b>Oh, you already told
her about me, did you?</b>

09:09.767 --> 09:13.307
<b>I mean, wouldn't that
be OK with Ms. Anastasia?</b>

09:13.357 --> 09:15.437
<b>You got that right, Natsuki.</b>

09:15.477 --> 09:17.817
<b>You have no reason to worry.</b>

09:17.857 --> 09:19.987
<b>I will keep my promise.</b>

09:22.567 --> 09:24.617
<b>[SUBARU] And what
about you, Meili?</b>

09:24.657 --> 09:26.197
<b>Are you doing your job?</b>

09:26.237 --> 09:28.747
<b>Well, we haven't run into
even a single mabeast since we</b>

09:28.787 --> 09:30.617
<b>got to the dunes, have we?</b>

09:30.657 --> 09:31.617
<b>I mean, no.</b>

09:31.657 --> 09:32.707
<b>But has that really</b>

09:32.747 --> 09:33.707
<b>been your doing?</b>

09:33.747 --> 09:35.997
<b>Oh, you doubt me?</b>

09:36.037 --> 09:37.167
<b>Have it your way.</b>

09:37.207 --> 09:38.257
<b>I'll show you just how much you</b>

09:38.297 --> 09:39.377
<b>should appreciate me instead.</b>

09:39.417 --> 09:40.377
<b>Huh?</b>

09:40.417 --> 09:45.097
<b>[rumbling]</b>

09:47.297 --> 09:50.227
<b>[roars]</b>

09:50.267 --> 09:51.727
<b>[snaps]</b>

09:51.767 --> 09:53.437
<b>[MEILI] There, all done.</b>

09:57.897 --> 09:59.477
<b>What was that?</b>

09:59.527 --> 10:01.687
<b>It was a sandworm, no doubt.</b>

10:01.737 --> 10:04.027
<b>But still, I don't
recall there being</b>

10:04.067 --> 10:05.657
<b>any record of one that large.</b>

10:05.697 --> 10:06.867
<b>So?</b>

10:06.907 --> 10:08.487
<b>Starting to see me
in a different light</b>

10:08.527 --> 10:10.577
<b>now after that little show?</b>

10:10.617 --> 10:15.537
<b>[gentle music]</b>

10:15.577 --> 10:22.877
<b>♪ ♪</b>

10:47.567 --> 10:50.487
<b>Oh, man, I'm dying to get
out of these damn dunes</b>

10:50.527 --> 10:51.827
<b>and into a bathtub.</b>

10:51.867 --> 10:53.867
<b>Right there with you.</b>

10:53.907 --> 10:57.127
<b>Anyway, you two, you've
realized by now, surely.</b>

10:57.167 --> 10:59.247
<b>Oh, yeah, I have.</b>

10:59.287 --> 11:02.547
<b>We've been heading straight
for the tower this entire time.</b>

11:02.587 --> 11:04.877
<b>[EMILIA] But we aren't
getting any closer to it.</b>

11:04.917 --> 11:07.677
<b>Reinhard said he was
never able to make it there.</b>

11:07.717 --> 11:08.887
<b>This must be why.</b>

11:08.927 --> 11:10.007
<b>[ANASTASIA] It's
because the space</b>

11:10.047 --> 11:11.047
<b>around here is warped.</b>

11:11.097 --> 11:12.257
<b>[JULIUS] Hmm?</b>

11:12.307 --> 11:13.517
<b>Uh, what do you
mean it's warped?</b>

11:13.557 --> 11:15.137
<b>Basically, it might
seem like the dunes</b>

11:15.177 --> 11:17.847
<b>and the tower are connected
with only sand between them,</b>

11:17.887 --> 11:19.397
<b>but they're not.</b>

11:19.437 --> 11:21.437
<b>In reality, it's
entirely possible</b>

11:21.477 --> 11:24.687
<b>that we're just running
around in endless circles.</b>

11:24.737 --> 11:25.687
<b>[JULIUS] I see.</b>

11:25.737 --> 11:26.687
<b>Then that's what really</b>

11:26.737 --> 11:27.737
<b>makes the Auguria Dunes</b>

11:27.777 --> 11:29.157
<b>so incredibly dangerous.</b>

11:29.197 --> 11:30.367
<b>It makes sense.</b>

11:30.407 --> 11:31.657
<b>[SUBARU] So are
we going to end up</b>

11:31.697 --> 11:33.657
<b>like the other
adventurers, overpowered</b>

11:33.697 --> 11:35.617
<b>by this wibbly wobbly space?</b>

11:35.657 --> 11:36.707
<b>We're different.</b>

11:36.747 --> 11:37.827
<b>I volunteered to guide y'all</b>

11:37.867 --> 11:39.377
<b>out to the Pleiades Watchtower</b>

11:39.417 --> 11:40.917
<b>for a reason.</b>

11:40.957 --> 11:43.297
<b>When a merchant heads out
to make a big purchase,</b>

11:43.337 --> 11:46.047
<b>they're always heading
out to win, you know.</b>

11:46.087 --> 11:49.047
<b>Then do you mean to say
that you're able to see</b>

11:49.087 --> 11:50.597
<b>a clear path to the tower?</b>

11:50.637 --> 11:53.057
<b>During the sand time,
when the wind picks up,</b>

11:53.097 --> 11:55.057
<b>it's the recoil
from space twisting</b>

11:55.097 --> 11:56.477
<b>and returning to normal.</b>

11:56.517 --> 11:59.227
<b>In other words, the periods
between the sand times</b>

11:59.267 --> 12:02.307
<b>are when the distortion
lets up, opening rifts.</b>

12:02.357 --> 12:05.067
<b>And through those little
cracks is the real sea of sand</b>

12:05.107 --> 12:07.187
<b>that's connected to the tower.</b>

12:07.237 --> 12:09.357
<b>The real sea of sand, huh?</b>

12:09.407 --> 12:12.117
<b>That's why it's a good
thing we have someone with us</b>

12:12.157 --> 12:13.617
<b>with a special
ability that'll help</b>

12:13.657 --> 12:16.077
<b>us find those pesky cracks.</b>

12:16.117 --> 12:21.287
<b>[mysterious music]</b>

12:27.967 --> 12:30.007
<b>[SUBARU] We need you to use
your clairvoyance to see</b>

12:30.047 --> 12:32.177
<b>through the eyes of mabeasts.</b>

12:32.217 --> 12:35.307
<b>If there are mabeasts that stay
active during the sand time,</b>

12:35.347 --> 12:37.477
<b>surely some must be coming
through the cracks in</b>

12:37.517 --> 12:38.677
<b>space somewhere.</b>

12:38.727 --> 12:40.597
<b>I wonder if it's a sandworm.</b>

12:40.637 --> 12:42.557
<b>[JULIUS] And to find
them, we have</b>

12:42.607 --> 12:45.227
<b>Meili locate the mabeasts
with her ability</b>

12:45.267 --> 12:47.237
<b>and tell Ms. Ram
where they are.</b>

12:48.437 --> 12:49.647
<b>No good.</b>

12:49.697 --> 12:52.527
<b>I've lost the connection
to that one.</b>

12:55.867 --> 12:58.907
<b>Subaru, it isn't right to put
Ram through any more of this.</b>

12:58.957 --> 13:00.957
<b>[RAM] Ms. Emilia.</b>

13:00.997 --> 13:03.377
<b>We don't have another choice.</b>

13:03.417 --> 13:04.787
<b>Only I can do this job.</b>

13:04.837 --> 13:06.087
<b>It's my duty.</b>

13:07.587 --> 13:10.547
<b>Meili, you can leave out the
mabeasts that are underground.</b>

13:10.587 --> 13:13.677
<b>It's a waste of effort when
I can only see sand ahead.</b>

13:13.717 --> 13:16.427
<b>I don't have a good handle
on telling them apart.</b>

13:16.467 --> 13:18.307
<b>[RAM] Maybe you should
try harder instead of</b>

13:18.347 --> 13:19.927
<b>giving up on them right away.</b>

13:19.977 --> 13:22.977
<b>[MEILI] I really don't think
the idea in itself is wrong.</b>

13:23.017 --> 13:26.647
<b>It's just a matter of catching
the right mabeast, I guess.</b>

13:26.687 --> 13:28.607
<b>If we're going to be forced
to leave it up to luck,</b>

13:28.647 --> 13:30.897
<b>I'm afraid we're
at a huge disadvantage.</b>

13:34.197 --> 13:35.367
<b>It's a bird.</b>

13:35.407 --> 13:37.117
<b>Can't believe
there's a bird that'd</b>

13:37.157 --> 13:38.447
<b>want to fly through this sky.</b>

13:38.497 --> 13:39.697
<b>A bird?</b>

13:41.537 --> 13:42.787
<b>[EMILIA] Natsuki?</b>

13:42.827 --> 13:45.337
<b>[suspenseful music]</b>

13:46.877 --> 13:48.587
<b>Subaru, did you see one?</b>

13:48.627 --> 13:49.627
<b>A ton.</b>

13:49.667 --> 13:51.007
<b>Ram, are you able to see</b>

13:51.047 --> 13:52.337
<b>through a bird's eyes?</b>

13:52.377 --> 13:53.837
<b>Why are you asking?</b>

13:53.877 --> 13:55.717
<b>[SUBARU] Those
birds are our key.</b>

13:57.887 --> 14:02.057
<b>[squawking]</b>

14:05.227 --> 14:06.647
<b>I'm connected.</b>

14:06.687 --> 14:07.897
<b>Yes.</b>

14:11.777 --> 14:13.897
<b>We're going to show
the sand time who's boss.</b>

14:13.947 --> 14:14.947
<b>Let's go.</b>

14:14.987 --> 14:19.657
<b>[exciting music]</b>

14:31.377 --> 14:32.467
<b>Straight.</b>

14:32.507 --> 14:33.757
<b>Keep going.</b>

14:35.797 --> 14:37.467
<b>Please let this work.</b>

14:37.507 --> 14:38.597
<b>Let this be it.</b>

14:38.637 --> 14:40.057
<b>I don't want to put them</b>

14:40.097 --> 14:41.097
<b>through any more.</b>

14:41.137 --> 14:43.927
<b>Come on.</b>

14:46.187 --> 14:49.147
<b>[thud]</b>

14:49.187 --> 14:52.817
<b>[gasps]</b>

14:55.527 --> 14:56.527
<b>We did it.</b>

14:56.567 --> 14:57.527
<b>It's finally over.</b>

14:57.567 --> 14:58.527
<b>It worked.</b>

14:58.577 --> 14:59.697
<b>We really did it.</b>

14:59.737 --> 15:00.907
<b>Hey, I'm right here.</b>

15:00.947 --> 15:02.407
<b>Quit screaming
in my ears, I suppose.</b>

15:02.447 --> 15:04.497
<b>Aw, no need to put
on airs with me.</b>

15:04.537 --> 15:05.867
<b>You can celebrate.</b>

15:05.907 --> 15:08.537
<b>Now, banzai.</b>

15:08.587 --> 15:12.127
<b>I say, banzai, I suppose.</b>

15:12.167 --> 15:13.127
<b>[SUBARU] Look at that.</b>

15:13.167 --> 15:14.257
<b>It's proof we made it</b>

15:14.297 --> 15:15.297
<b>to the next stage.</b>

15:15.337 --> 15:16.507
<b>The dunes turned into</b>

15:16.547 --> 15:18.177
<b>an endless field of flowers.</b>

15:18.217 --> 15:20.847
<b>Field of flowers?</b>

15:20.887 --> 15:22.717
<b>That's not right.</b>

15:23.927 --> 15:25.347
<b>They're Oiran Bears.</b>

15:25.387 --> 15:27.637
<b>[rumbling]</b>

15:28.897 --> 15:30.807
<b>[growling]</b>

15:30.857 --> 15:32.317
<b>Subaru, what's going on?</b>

15:32.357 --> 15:33.857
<b>Ram's clairvoyance suddenly--</b>

15:33.897 --> 15:35.147
<b>Stop.</b>

15:35.187 --> 15:37.647
<b>Meili, stay calm.</b>

15:37.697 --> 15:39.157
<b>Keep quiet.</b>

15:40.317 --> 15:42.947
<b>[roars]</b>

15:44.617 --> 15:45.867
<b>Shh.</b>

15:45.907 --> 15:47.997
<b>Hey, don't move, OK?</b>

15:48.037 --> 15:50.707
<b>[intense music]</b>

15:50.747 --> 15:53.917
<b>[tutting]</b>

16:03.137 --> 16:05.597
<b>[sighs]</b>

16:05.637 --> 16:08.557
<b>[growls]</b>

16:08.597 --> 16:09.937
<b>[roars]</b>

16:09.977 --> 16:11.227
<b>No!</b>

16:13.937 --> 16:17.147
<b>[roars]</b>

16:22.277 --> 16:23.237
<b>Go.</b>

16:23.277 --> 16:24.527
<b>Now.</b>

16:27.707 --> 16:28.657
<b>This is bad.</b>

16:28.707 --> 16:29.707
<b>Why are they so fast?</b>

16:29.747 --> 16:30.707
<b>Hey.</b>

16:30.747 --> 16:31.997
<b>Yah!</b>

16:32.037 --> 16:33.337
<b>Take that!</b>

16:33.377 --> 16:35.667
<b>Take a whole bunch of 'em!</b>

16:35.707 --> 16:36.707
<b>Oh, yeah.</b>

16:36.757 --> 16:38.257
<b>That's my girl for you.</b>

16:38.297 --> 16:41.507
<b>Barusu, if you want to live,
push her to the limit.</b>

16:41.547 --> 16:43.927
<b>Don't worry,
I-- what was that?</b>

16:45.557 --> 16:48.637
<b>[slashing sound]</b>

16:50.227 --> 16:52.727
<b>It would be unseemly
of me to allow Ms. Emilia</b>

16:52.767 --> 16:54.307
<b>to shoulder all of the work.</b>

16:54.357 --> 16:56.067
<b>Damn, I can't
let him be better.</b>

16:56.107 --> 16:57.527
<b>Beako, ready to do this?</b>

16:57.567 --> 16:58.817
<b>Of course I am.</b>

16:58.857 --> 16:59.897
<b>That's never a worry.</b>

16:59.947 --> 17:01.197
<b>It's you who'd better not</b>

17:01.237 --> 17:02.567
<b>run out of gas, I suppose.</b>

17:02.617 --> 17:03.907
<b>Minya.</b>

17:03.947 --> 17:06.987
<b>[shattering]</b>

17:09.957 --> 17:12.537
<b>Go and give them all you've
got, my little sandworm.</b>

17:12.577 --> 17:13.787
<b>Crush them all to dust!</b>

17:18.167 --> 17:19.587
<b>Just a little further.</b>

17:19.627 --> 17:21.417
<b>We've got to charge
straight for the watchtower.</b>

17:21.467 --> 17:22.717
<b>Huh?</b>

17:24.387 --> 17:26.137
<b>What?</b>

17:29.017 --> 17:31.637
<b>[tutting]</b>

17:33.727 --> 17:35.147
<b>I died and went back?</b>

17:35.187 --> 17:36.857
<b>Why?
When?</b>

17:36.897 --> 17:38.147
<b>What happened?</b>

17:38.187 --> 17:39.317
<b>How did I die?</b>

17:39.357 --> 17:40.737
<b>Shit, shit, shit,</b>

17:40.777 --> 17:42.527
<b>shit, shit, shit.</b>

17:44.737 --> 17:46.027
<b>[roars]</b>

17:46.067 --> 17:47.037
<b>What?</b>

17:47.077 --> 17:48.077
<b>No.</b>

17:48.117 --> 17:49.197
<b>Julius!</b>

17:49.237 --> 17:51.537
<b>[roars]</b>

17:51.577 --> 17:52.617
<b>Damn.</b>

17:52.657 --> 17:54.957
<b>Go, as fast as you can now.</b>

17:56.667 --> 17:57.997
<b>[EMILIA] Take that.</b>

17:58.047 --> 17:58.997
<b>Subaru.</b>

17:59.047 --> 18:00.297
<b>Beatrice.</b>

18:02.007 --> 18:03.297
<b>Minya.</b>

18:03.337 --> 18:05.717
<b>[shattering]</b>

18:07.137 --> 18:10.597
<b>[MEILI] I've got a present
for you-- my precious sandworm!</b>

18:10.637 --> 18:13.847
<b>[rumbling]</b>

18:13.887 --> 18:15.137
<b>Go!</b>

18:17.607 --> 18:18.777
<b>Damn it.</b>

18:18.817 --> 18:19.897
<b>Everything's going exactly</b>

18:19.937 --> 18:21.147
<b>the same way as before.</b>

18:21.187 --> 18:22.857
<b>Barusu, if you want to live,</b>

18:22.897 --> 18:24.237
<b>push her to the limit.</b>

18:24.277 --> 18:26.277
<b>Ram, don't head
for the tower yet.</b>

18:26.317 --> 18:27.987
<b>We gotta find another route.</b>

18:28.027 --> 18:29.077
<b>[RAM] What do you mean?</b>

18:29.117 --> 18:30.197
<b>It's a straight line,</b>

18:30.237 --> 18:31.617
<b>and there's no other way.</b>

18:31.657 --> 18:33.327
<b>We can't go straight there.</b>

18:33.367 --> 18:35.917
<b>We have to change direction.</b>

18:35.957 --> 18:38.707
<b>Ram, do what Subaru says.</b>

18:38.747 --> 18:41.087
<b>He would never blurt out
something nonsensical and silly</b>

18:41.127 --> 18:42.417
<b>without a good reason.</b>

18:42.457 --> 18:44.507
<b>Barusu speaks
nonsense and falsehoods</b>

18:44.547 --> 18:45.757
<b>on a daily basis, though.</b>

18:45.797 --> 18:47.007
<b>He would never blurt out</b>

18:47.047 --> 18:48.597
<b>something nonsensical and silly</b>

18:48.637 --> 18:50.597
<b>when we're obviously
in grave danger.</b>

18:50.637 --> 18:51.967
<b>Thank you for the rephrase.</b>

18:52.017 --> 18:53.847
<b>I really feel your support.</b>

18:57.107 --> 19:00.187
<b>You two up top, don't let
yourselves get shaken off.</b>

19:02.937 --> 19:07.117
<b>[roars]</b>

19:09.827 --> 19:10.787
<b>Huh?</b>

19:10.827 --> 19:12.237
<b>Dodge!</b>

19:12.287 --> 19:16.957
<b>[rumbling]</b>

19:21.167 --> 19:24.087
<b>[groans]</b>

19:26.167 --> 19:27.547
<b>That was a close one.</b>

19:28.717 --> 19:30.257
<b>Subaru, we messed up.</b>

19:30.297 --> 19:31.257
<b>Huh?</b>

19:31.307 --> 19:32.517
<b>We got separated from</b>

19:32.557 --> 19:34.307
<b>Emilia's carriage, I suppose.</b>

19:34.347 --> 19:36.347
<b>Now it's just you
and Betty out here.</b>

19:36.387 --> 19:37.387
<b>What?</b>

19:37.437 --> 19:38.477
<b>At this point, I'd take</b>

19:38.517 --> 19:39.687
<b>fighting that bastard Regulus</b>

19:39.727 --> 19:41.267
<b>again over figuring this out.</b>

19:41.317 --> 19:43.857
<b>No time for whining
and complaining, I suppose.</b>

19:43.897 --> 19:45.187
<b>We have to find a way back to--</b>

19:45.227 --> 19:46.607
<b>Yeah, I know that.</b>

19:46.647 --> 19:48.237
<b>I'm trying to think.</b>

19:50.487 --> 19:53.737
<b>[slicing noise]</b>

19:56.077 --> 19:57.707
<b>What just--</b>

19:57.747 --> 20:01.667
<b>[groans]</b>

20:01.707 --> 20:03.797
<b>Subaru.</b>

20:03.837 --> 20:04.957
<b>Subaru.</b>

20:05.007 --> 20:06.207
<b>Subaru.</b>

20:08.507 --> 20:10.137
<b>No, you can't.</b>

20:10.177 --> 20:11.137
<b>You can't die.</b>

20:11.177 --> 20:12.677
<b>Don't you dare die.</b>

20:12.717 --> 20:15.097
<b>Don't leave me all alone.</b>

20:15.137 --> 20:18.937
<b>Don't-- don't you go
and leave Betty behind.</b>

20:20.687 --> 20:25.897
<b>[explosion]</b>

20:35.577 --> 20:38.707
<b>[tutting]</b>

20:38.747 --> 20:42.957
<b>[mysterious music]</b>

20:47.877 --> 20:51.927
<b>[SUBARU] The first and second
death were both from--</b>

20:53.137 --> 20:59.517
<b>[grunts]</b>

20:59.557 --> 21:03.227
<b>[heavy breathing]</b>

21:05.477 --> 21:07.277
<b>Beako, I love you.</b>

21:07.317 --> 21:08.277
<b>Huh?</b>

21:08.317 --> 21:09.357
<b>[muffled gasp]</b>

21:09.397 --> 21:12.317
<b>Invisible Providence.</b>

21:18.827 --> 21:20.577
<b>What a good boy.</b>

21:20.617 --> 21:25.247
<b>[grunts]</b>

21:35.807 --> 21:38.677
<b>[SUBARU] There's something
I want to ask you guys.</b>

21:38.717 --> 21:41.557
<b>Did anyone else see a flash
of light coming from the tower?</b>

21:41.597 --> 21:43.517
<b>[EMILIA] Why, did
you see something?</b>

21:43.557 --> 21:44.807
<b>[SUBARU] Yeah.</b>

21:44.857 --> 21:47.397
<b>And this light, what
do you think it was?</b>

21:47.437 --> 21:51.237
<b>I think probably
something dangerous.</b>

21:51.277 --> 21:53.567
<b>Definitely not
friendly, at least.</b>

21:53.607 --> 21:55.067
<b>Based only on a hunch?</b>

21:55.117 --> 21:58.157
<b>Well, pretty much, yeah.</b>

21:58.197 --> 21:59.867
<b>Ah, that's troubling.</b>

21:59.907 --> 22:01.037
<b>But it's just a hunch.</b>

22:01.077 --> 22:02.077
<b>You believe me?</b>

22:02.117 --> 22:03.827
<b>It's your hunch, after all.</b>

22:03.867 --> 22:06.497
<b>So it's a matter we
should take seriously.</b>

22:07.377 --> 22:08.627
<b>Oh.</b>

22:09.797 --> 22:11.047
<b>Ram?</b>

22:12.547 --> 22:16.797
<b>It's Barasu that
it's watching.</b>

22:16.847 --> 22:19.557
<b>[high pitched whistle]</b>

22:21.097 --> 22:22.347
<b>I've got it!</b>

22:23.557 --> 22:27.687
<b>[smashing noise]</b>

22:31.817 --> 22:34.527
<b>[grunts]</b>

22:38.617 --> 22:39.697
<b>Needle?</b>

22:39.737 --> 22:42.197
<b>[RAM] Barusu, there's another.</b>

22:42.247 --> 22:44.037
<b>Beako, are you ready?</b>

22:44.077 --> 22:45.827
<b>Obviously.</b>

22:46.917 --> 22:48.247
<b>EMT.</b>

22:48.287 --> 22:49.627
<b>I suppose.</b>

22:50.877 --> 22:55.257
<b>[swooshing]</b>

22:55.297 --> 22:57.217
<b>[clangs]</b>

22:57.257 --> 22:58.387
<b>What did you do?</b>

22:58.427 --> 23:01.217
<b>Absolute nullification
magic, EMT.</b>

23:01.267 --> 23:03.727
<b>When any magic reaches
this field surrounding us,</b>

23:03.767 --> 23:05.637
<b>it sputters out in an instant.</b>

23:05.687 --> 23:07.517
<b>The catch, it doesn't
last too long.</b>

23:07.557 --> 23:08.557
<b>[rumbling]</b>

23:08.607 --> 23:09.647
<b>What the?</b>

23:09.687 --> 23:10.897
<b>We made a mistake.</b>

23:10.937 --> 23:12.227
<b>It would seem the EMT we cast</b>

23:12.277 --> 23:13.317
<b>is making the distortion</b>

23:13.357 --> 23:14.487
<b>in space come undone.</b>

23:14.527 --> 23:15.737
<b>I get it.</b>

23:15.777 --> 23:17.197
<b>The sand time works
the exact same way</b>

23:17.237 --> 23:19.157
<b>as Beako's door crossing.</b>

23:20.407 --> 23:24.577
<b>[screaming]</b>

23:25.787 --> 23:30.497
<b>[intense music]</b>

23:37.127 --> 23:39.007
<b>[WOMAN] I found you.</b>
